      "value": "<p>A hardened habitat shell anchored at the inner edge of the storm belt, occupied for two seasons between 2276 and 2301 and abandoned after the second. It was designed for a wind that turned out to be the median rather than the maximum. The wreck is still there, half sunk in mud, and is monitored from orbit as a corrosion reference.</p>",
